data: {"type": "message_complete", "message": {"content": "[Using astrology_ai agent]\n\nCasting both Kundlis and matching the 36 gunas... \ud83d\udc9e\n\n\n```match_report\n{\"type\": \"match_report\", \"groom\": {\"moon_rashi\": \"Aries\", \"nakshatra\": \"Bharani\", \"manglik\": false, \"time_known\": true, \"moon_rashi_alternatives\": [], \"nakshatra_alternatives\": []}, \"bride\": {\"moon_rashi\": \"Aries\", \"nakshatra\": null, \"manglik\": null, \"time_known\": false, \"moon_rashi_alternatives\": [], \"nakshatra_alternatives\": []}, \"kootas\": [{\"name\": \"Varna\", \"points\": 1.0, \"max\": 1, \"note\": \"Kshatriya + Kshatriya\", \"meaning\": \"spiritual compatibility & ego balance\", \"time_dependent\": false, \"pending\": false, \"provisional\": false}, {\"name\": \"Vashya\", \"points\": 2.0, \"max\": 2, \"note\": \"Chatushpada + Chatushpada\", \"meaning\": \"mutual influence & attraction\", \"time_dependent\": false, \"pending\": false, \"provisional\": false}, {\"name\": \"Tara\", \"points\": null, \"max\": 3, \"note\": \"needs a birth time \\u2014 this koota is read from the Moon's nakshatra\", \"meaning\": \"destiny & shared fortune\", \"time_dependent\": true, \"pending\": true, \"provisional\": false}, {\"name\": \"Yoni\", \"points\": null, \"max\": 4, \"note\": \"needs a birth time \\u2014 this koota is read from the Moon's nakshatra\", \"meaning\": \"physical & instinctive harmony\", \"time_dependent\": true, \"pending\": true, \"provisional\": false}, {\"name\": \"Graha Maitri\", \"points\": 5.0, \"max\": 5, \"note\": \"same lord (Mars)\", \"meaning\": \"mental connection & friendship\", \"time_dependent\": false, \"pending\": false, \"provisional\": false}, {\"name\": \"Gana\", \"points\": null, \"max\": 6, \"note\": \"needs a birth time \\u2014 this koota is read from the Moon's nakshatra\", \"meaning\": \"temperament match\", \"time_dependent\": true, \"pending\": true, \"provisional\": false}, {\"name\": \"Bhakoot\", \"points\": 7.0, \"max\": 7, \"note\": \"1/1 placement\", \"meaning\": \"prosperity & family welfare\", \"time_dependent\": false, \"pending\": false, \"provisional\": false}, {\"name\": \"Nadi\", \"points\": null, \"max\": 8, \"note\": \"needs a birth time \\u2014 this koota is read from the Moon's nakshatra\", \"meaning\": \"health & progeny\", \"time_dependent\": true, \"pending\": true, \"provisional\": false}], \"time_known\": false, \"total\": null, \"max_total\": null, \"firm_total\": 15.0, \"firm_max\": 15, \"pending_max\": 21, \"pending_reasons\": [\"Nadi dosha (health and progeny) cannot be checked without both birth times \\u2014 it is read from the Moon's nakshatra.\", \"Mangal (Kuja) dosha needs Mars's house, which needs a birth time \\u2014 it is not assessed here.\"], \"verdict\": \"incomplete\", \"doshas\": []}\n```\n\n### Kundli Milan \u2014 15 of 15 firm points, 21 pending\n\n*A birth time is missing, so the four nakshatra-based kootas (Tara, Yoni, Gana, Nadi \u2014 21 of the 36 points) were not scored. What is below is computed; the rest is genuinely unknown, not estimated.*\n\n**Moon signs:** person 1: Aries (Bharani); person 2: Aries (nakshatra unknown without a birth time)\n\n| Koota | Score | What it reads |\n|---|---|---|\n| Varna | 1/1 | spiritual compatibility & ego balance \u2014 Kshatriya + Kshatriya |\n| Vashya | 2/2 | mutual influence & attraction \u2014 Chatushpada + Chatushpada |\n| Tara | pending | destiny & shared fortune \u2014 needs a birth time \u2014 this koota is read from the Moon's nakshatra |\n| Yoni | pending | physical & instinctive harmony \u2014 needs a birth time \u2014 this koota is read from the Moon's nakshatra |\n| Graha Maitri | 5/5 | mental connection & friendship \u2014 same lord (Mars) |\n| Gana | pending | temperament match \u2014 needs a birth time \u2014 this koota is read from the Moon's nakshatra |\n| Bhakoot | 7/7 | prosperity & family welfare \u2014 1/1 placement |\n| Nadi | pending | health & progeny \u2014 needs a birth time \u2014 this koota is read from the Moon's nakshatra |\n\n> \u23f3 Nadi dosha (health and progeny) cannot be checked without both birth times \u2014 it is read from the Moon's nakshatra.\n\n> \u23f3 Mangal (Kuja) dosha needs Mars's house, which needs a birth time \u2014 it is not assessed here.\n\n\n\n```input_request\n{\"type\": \"input_request\", \"ask\": \"save_match_offer\", \"reason\": \"Saving keeps their birth date, birth time and birth place, the name you give them, and this scorecard \u2014 on your account, until you delete it. Deleting them removes all of it in one action; a dated record that you gave this permission is kept, with their name removed from it. They are not notified and do not need an account. There is no option to keep only the score: a score that cannot name what produced it can never be re-checked, or corrected when a birth detail changes.\", \"fields\": [{\"key\": \"save_match\", \"kind\": \"choice\", \"label\": \"Save this match?\", \"required\": false, \"allow_unknown\": false, \"options\": [{\"value\": \"save\", \"label\": \"Save to my matches\"}, {\"value\": \"skip\", \"label\": \"Don't save\"}]}, {\"key\": \"person2_name\", \"kind\": \"text\", \"label\": \"What should I call them?\", \"required\": true, \"allow_unknown\": false}]}\n```\n\n#### Your Story Together\n\nMy dear child, it is a pleasure to look into this connection for you. Seeing two souls with their Moon signs in Aries is like seeing two bright, pioneering spirits who have found each other. Based on the information we have, a beautiful foundation is visible, though the full picture is not yet complete. We have a firm score of 15 out of a possible 15 points from the kootas that do not depend on a precise birth time. A significant 21 points, which are read from the Moon's nakshatra, are pending until the bride's time of birth is known. I would be happy to review those for you once you have it.\n\nThe story that these numbers tell begins with a profound sense of recognition and friendship. With both Moons in the same sign, ruled by the same planet, the Graha Maitri (mental friendship) is as strong as it can be. This suggests a life where you feel you are on the same team, with a shared worldview and a natural understanding of how the other thinks. You are equals, peers on a similar life path (Varna), drawn to one another with a powerful and balanced influence (Vashya). The full strength of the Bhakoot koota points to an easy emotional flow between you, suggesting that you can build a family life and grow together with a sense of shared purpose and harmony, navigating life's joys and sorrows as one.\n\nWhat remains to be seen are the deeper currents of the relationship that are revealed by the nakshatras. These are the aspects that give a marriage its unique texture and require conscious nurturing over the years. Without a birth time for the bride, we cannot assess these four important areas. They are the keys to understanding the finer dynamics of your shared destiny, physical harmony, temperamental compatibility, and long-term health as a couple. These are not obstacles, but simply areas that, once understood, can be tended to with care and attention, strengthening the bond you share.\n\nHere is a summary of what we can see so far:\n\n*   **A Foundation of Friendship:** The perfect score in **Graha Maitri** suggests a deep mental and psychological connection, a true meeting of minds.\n*   **Emotional & Family Harmony:** The full points in **Bhakoot** indicate a powerful capacity for emotional understanding and building a prosperous, happy family life together.\n*   **Mutual Respect & Attraction:** Strong **Varna** and **Vashya** scores point to a relationship of equals with a natural, compelling attraction to one another.\n*   **Areas for Future Review:** The compatibility in **Tara** (shared destiny), **Yoni** (instinctive harmony), **Gana** (temperament), and **Nadi** (health and progeny) are the important kootas that remain to be checked.\n\nRemember, this ancient system offers guidance on tendencies and alignments, not a factual forecast of the future.\n\n```reading_subject\n{\"type\": \"reading_subject\", \"mode\": \"self\", \"person_id\": null, \"name\": null, \"relation\": null, \"label\": \"You\"}\n```\n", "finish_reason": "stop"}}

